<title>UK: Libya tenders to buy two cargoes white sugar - trade.</title>
<headline>Libya tenders to buy two cargoes white sugar - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Libya tendered on Tuesday to buy two cargoes of white sugar for shipment in February/March, traders said.</p>
<p>The quality specified in the tender was 45 ICUMSA, they said.</p>
<p>Last October, Libya bought two cargoes of the same quality white sugar at $382.00 per tonne c &amp; f for December delivery, with the seller said to be a French trade house.</p>
<p>-- Jeremy Smith, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8064</p>
